      "text": "@NVIDIAAI Smaller beating bigger is the detail that matters. If a 117 million parameter model can match models ten times its size, the advantage shifts from raw scale to clever reuse. Efficiency like this is what lets good ideas run on ordinary hardware, not just in a lab.",
