      "text": "@NVIDIAAI Looping trades parameters for FLOPs, so \"10x smaller\" needs an accuracy-vs-FLOPs curve against the larger models, plus latency and activation memory. Two questions: does accuracy extrapolate past the loop count seen in training, and does the per-loop gain saturate or oscillate?",
